## POSITIVE SECURITY ASPECTS

1. ✓ Base64url encoding used for project IDs (prevents casual tampering)
2. ✓ `ensureDir()` called before writing agents/commands (prevents missing directory errors)
3. ✓ Content read with `fs.readFileSync()` wrapped in try-catch
4. ✓ No RCE endpoints (code execution not possible)
5. ✓ No SQL injection (no database)
6. ✓ JSON input parsing is safe (express.json() validates)

